PositionFactory::setMintCurveConvexConfig(MintCurveConvexConfig)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when frxUsd is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    ├── when curvePool is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    ├── when convexBooster is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    ├── when convexRewardPool is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    ├── when crv is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    ├── when cvx is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    ├── when curve pool N_COINS is not 2
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryInvalidConfig
    └── when config is valid
        ├── it should set mintCurveConvexConfig
        └── it should emit MintCurveConvexConfigSet
